{
    "background_story": "In the quaint medieval town of Ashwood, Luca was a devout and respected priest. He was particularly known for his role as the advowson holder of the local church, responsible for presenting candidates for ecclesiastical benefices. Luca took his duties seriously, ensuring that only the most worthy and pious individuals were appointed to serve the community. His fairness and integrity earned him the trust of the townspeople, who would often seek his counsel on matters of faith and morality. One day, a severe storm damaged the church, and Luca rallied the community to rebuild it. Through his tireless efforts, the church was restored to its former glory, and Luca's reputation as a selfless and devoted leader was solidified. His legacy as a guardian of the faith and a champion of the community continued for generations.",
